          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-03T01:04:04.857Z",
          "html": "<p>Will be:  5 seconds, and saving never moves the page.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>P60's plan will say 5 seconds;  Enter or a click away still saves at once.</li>\n  <li>Its headless check will measure the page's scroll and the box's place before and after each save, and fail if either moves.</li>\n  <li>Folded into P60's plan together with your pick of how editing starts (the details page, \"Edit Text in Place: how it starts\").</li>\n</ul>"
        }
      ],
