          "at": "2026-11-03T01:10:50.522Z",
          "html": "<p>Will be:  <code>&lt;ui-markdown editable&gt;</code> edits in place (⌥-click).</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><code>editable</code> means the Write / Preview tabs today:  those become <code>editable=\"tabs\"</code>.</li>\n  <li>Only its components page and its test use it now;  both follow, in P60.</li>\n</ul>"
